> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @ginger{1/2%tsp}, @grapeseed oil{1/20%cup}, @bean sprouts{1/4%cup}, @tamarind paste{1/4%tbsp}, @gluten-free fish sauce{1/2%tbsp}, @shrimp{1/4%lb} (deveined; inferred from recipe title), @red pepper{1/8%tsp}, @scallions{3/4}, @carrot{1/4}, @lime juice{1/4%tbsp}, @red cabbage{1/2%cup}, @garlic{1/4%clove}, @brown sugar{1/4%tbsp}, @fresno pepper{1/4}, @mixed herbs{1/2%cup}.

== Preparation ==

Prepare grains, proteins and other cooked components as required, then cool or hold warm as appropriate.

Combine measured ingredients, dress to taste and serve.
